        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动：</span>用<span>奥义！暮临</span>或这个技能造成伤害时，会回复<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">50能量</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动：</span>慎进行冲刺，<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">嘲讽</span>英雄和野怪1.5秒并造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/85/110/135/160 + ([[si:scalehealth]]11% 额外生命值))物理伤害</span>。",
